sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    CS->>CSMS: Close WebSocket connection
    Note over CS: Wait a number of seconds equal to <Configured Transaction Duration>
    CS->>CSMS: Reconnect to the CSMS

    CSMS->>CS: GetTransactionStatusRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionId must be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: GetTransactionStatusResponse (ongoingIndicator omitted, messagesInQueue = true)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, meterValues present, offline = true)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
